      "figure": null,
      "supplement": null,
      "character_start": null,
      "character_end": null,
      "verbatim_excerpt": "Identification was confirmed by detection of penicillin-binding protein 2a (PBP2a) by latex agglutination test (PBP2′ Test Kit, Oxoid, Hants, UK). Typing was performed by SmaI pulsed-field gel electrophoresis as previously described (2), and the isolate was classified as the USA300 clone. Genes encoding production of the Panton-Valentine leukocidin (PVL) were identified by real-time PCR (3).",
